    t[2982385683]="Notably forming packed swarms, this fish gets its namesake from the friction of its inky black scales oscillating against each other. These vibrations act as a deterrent for predators and create an audible sound that can be heard above the water. $B$B|cnGREEN_FONT_COLOR:Special:|r$B$B|T$1:$2|t Whispers of the Deep$B$BUse the Whispering Stargazer to draw out Slumbering Coelacanths from the depths of Azj-Kahet.$B$B|cnGREEN_FONT_COLOR:Areas you can find this fish:|R$B$B- Isle of Dorn$B- The Ringing Deeps$B- Hallowfall$B$B|cnGREEN_FONT_COLOR:Fishing Pools:|r$B$B- Stargazer Swarm$B"
